      "statement": "The MCP server exposes five tools — workflow, chat, thread_state, list_orchestrator_tools, list_orchestrator_tools_detailed — each gated by a per-tool digikey scope (digigraph:workflow, digigraph:chat, digigraph:mcp). With DIGI_MCP_REQUIRE_AUTH=1, every tool verifies a digikey RS256 bearer token through the full signature/issuer/audience/exp/blocklist/scope chain via _authorize_mcp_ctx, failing closed when no verifier is configured or the transport carries no HTTP headers (stdio).",
